    revenue_evidence: "https://docs.trishool.ai (source: github.com/TrishoolAI/trishool-ai-docs, content/faq.mdx) \u2014 'The subnet currently burns 80% of emissions; successful miners share the remaining 20%... The burn is a dial, not a fixed rule: it is expected to step down in stages as the subnet's demand share crosses on-chain milestones, potentially down to 0%.' An 80% burn pegged to future demand milestones is the operator stating there is no paying demand yet. Corroborated by https://trishool.ai \u2014 'PHASE 7 - PLANNED: Guard API / SDK' \u2014 the sellable product does not exist. Astroware's product page ends in 'Contact Sales' with no pricing on any tier.",
