    revenue_evidence: "No paid product exists to generate revenue. Macrocosmos removed all SN25 documentation (https://github.com/macrocosm-os/macrocosmos-content commit 2026-05-20 'GITBOOK-623: Delete Sn37 + 25 docs') and SN25 no longer appears on https://www.macrocosmos.ai/ or https://docs.macrocosmos.ai/. The subnet runs 100% incentive burn with 1 active miner, so no work is being produced or sold. Note Macrocosmos as a company does monetise SN13/Gravity \u2014 that revenue is NOT attributable to SN25.",
