    revenue_evidence: "https://www.perturbai.io/whitepaper \u2014 the whitepaper lists monetisation as forward-looking targets only: months 3-6 '$15,000 MRR', months 6-12 '$80,000 MRR', year 2 '$500,000+ ARR'. Subscription tiers (Research 100K examples/mo, Professional 1M/mo, Enterprise unlimited) are named but carry no prices. No customer is named anywhere on the site or in the repo, and https://www.perturbai.io/leaderboard returns HTTP 404. Trailing revenue is therefore zero.",
