    revenue_evidence: "No pricing page, no customer-facing purchase path, and no disclosed figure exists. The strongest counter-signal is in their own code: the README at https://github.com/SILX-LABS/Orion documents an orchestrator that 'advances customer orders' and an '--execute-paid-canary' launch flag, showing a commercial flow is designed and partially built. But the deployment is labelled 'sn27-mainnet-pilot-001' (pilot), on-chain shows only 1 active miner, and no order volume, price per token/record, or customer is disclosed anywhere. Nothing to derive an estimate from.",
