    revenue_evidence: "https://coldint.io/ \u2014 the operator's own site states it has no new plan for the subnet and describes the model as not having worked in a dTAO world; no pricing page, no product, no API, no customers exist anywhere across coldint.io, hotfloat.io or the declared repo. Revenue is therefore zero, not merely unmeasured.",
