    revenue_evidence: "https://graph.graphite-ai.net/src/pricing.jsx \u2014 the live pricing component defines exactly three tiers: Explorer price 'Free' (100 graph queries/month), Builder price 'Coming soon' (500,000 queries/month, CTA 'Get notified', mailto team@graphite-ai.net), Enterprise price 'Custom' (CTA 'Talk to sales'). No dollar figure is published anywhere and the only non-free self-serve tier is not yet purchasable. A /api/v1/billing/checkout route exists in the OpenAPI schema (https://api.graphite-ai.net/openapi.json) but no plan is buyable through it. Adoption proxy: PyPI graphite-mcp had 30 downloads in the last month, 0 in the last day (https://pypistats.org/api/packages/graphite-mcp/recent), i.e. effectively no paying-scale usage.",
