    revenue_evidence: "No pricing anywhere. nepher.ai offers only 'Get started free'; there is no pricing or plans page, no checkout, no customer logos (only an unnamed 'trusted by robotics teams worldwide' claim and NVIDIA Inception membership, which is a free program). The one endpoint literally named pricing \u2014 https://tournament-api.nepher.ai/api/v1/tournaments/pricing?subnet_uid=49 \u2014 is not product pricing, it returns FX conversion: {\"network\":\"finney\",\"subnet_uid\":49,\"alpha_to_tao\":0.006979202,\"tao_to_usd\":199.6}. Tournament entry is free to miners. Conclusion: zero external revenue.",
