    perf_delta: "Researched 2026-08-12. INACTIVE \u2014 parked, deregistered or abandoned.",
    benchmark_summary: "SN73 is parked. The on-chain subnet_name is literally \"Parked\" and every other identity field \u2014 github_repo, subnet_url, subnet_contact, discord, description, summary, logo_url, tags \u2014 is blank. This netuid previously hosted MetaHash, a treasury/governance vehicle run by the Metahash Group that used deterministic multi-epoch auctions to acquire and settle subnet alpha across a portfolio of Bittensor subnets (compute, robotics, data, agents, advertising). That operation is gone: the former site metahash73.com no longer resolves (connection failure, no HTTP response), and the former repository fx-integral/metahash returns 404 while the fx-integral account now hosts only unrelated projects (academia, academia-archives, merit). Chain state confirms the parked status: emission 0, 1 active miner against a 256-neuron cap, and 359 blocks since the last epoch step. There is no product, no code and no operator surface today. The existing AlphaGap record (score 40, name \"Parked\", $0 revenue) had the revenue right but the score far too high for a netuid that is doing nothing. AUDIT: Nothing to audit \u2014 no code, no site, no docs, no disclosed operator. The former MetaHash repository has been removed from GitHub entirely, so even the historical auction/settlement logic is no longer publicly inspectable, which is itself a red flag for anyone who holds the alpha: the mechanism that governed treasury settlement cannot now be reviewed. No third-party audit was ever found. The owner coldkey is 5Fvs6HPWUKNkqQka8yZi1anaTu339fKVws64BnJBRTQhKzak and it retains unilateral control of the netuid, including the ability to rename it and repoint identity at any time. Twelve validators remain registered but with zero emission and a stalled epoch cadence they are not performing observable work. Total single point of failure; effectively an empty slot held by one key. CAVEATS: I could not determine WHY MetaHash wound down, whether alpha holders were made whole, or whether the team migrated to another netuid or entity \u2014 the removal of the domain and the repo destroyed the public record, and I found no announcement. It is therefore also possible the netuid is being deliberately held for resale or for a future relaunch under a new project, which would change its value materially; I have no evidence either way and have scored the observable state only. I could not verify the current owner's identity or whether the coldkey still belongs to the original Metahash Group. Any existing AlphaGap copy describing SN73 as an active treasury/auction layer for alpha acquisition is now stale and should be retired \u2014 that description reflects a business that no longer has any public presence.",
    active_users: "No operating entity remains to generate revenue. The former product domain metahash73.com fails to connect (curl returns HTTP 000, no DNS/TCP response), the former repo https://github.com/fx-integral/metahash returns 404, and on-chain identity is fully cleared with subnet_name \"Parked\" (https://api.taostats.io/api/subnet/identity/v1?netuid=73). Chain state shows emission 0 with 1 active miner (https://api.taostats.io/api/subnet/latest/v1?netuid=73).",
    annual_revenue_usd: 0,
    revenue_confidence: "confirmed_pre_revenue",
    revenue_evidence: "No operating entity remains to generate revenue. The former product domain metahash73.com fails to connect (curl returns HTTP 000, no DNS/TCP response), the former repo https://github.com/fx-integral/metahash returns 404, and on-chain identity is fully cleared with subnet_name \"Parked\" (https://api.taostats.io/api/subnet/identity/v1?netuid=73). Chain state shows emission 0 with 1 active miner (https://api.taostats.io/api/subnet/latest/v1?netuid=73).",
    last_updated: "2026-08-12",
    sources: ["https://api.taostats.io/api/subnet/identity/v1?netuid=73", "https://api.taostats.io/api/subnet/latest/v1?netuid=73", "https://github.com/fx-integral", "https://api.github.com/users/fx-integral/repos", "https://github.com/fx-integral/metahash", "https://metahash73.com", "https://taostats.io/subnets/73"],
