    revenue_evidence: "https://tensorusd.com \u2014 the site's own 'Protocol Overview: a real-time snapshot of the protocol's on-chain health' block reads: '$0.00 $TUSDT Minted', 'Total Value Locked 0.00 TAO', 'Active Vaults 0', alongside 'Liquidation Fee 11%' and 'Interest Fee 10%'. Arithmetic: protocol revenue = 10% annual interest x $0 debt outstanding + 11% x $0 liquidated = $0. Corroborated by https://docs.tensorusd.com/roadmap-and-growth/roadmap, which still lists 'Paid subnet usage' / revenue validation as a Q3 2026 target and shows the Feb-Mar 2026 'platform launch' phase as still pending as of August 2026.",
