    revenue_evidence: "Actively checked and found no monetisation of any kind: there is no pricing page, no paid tier, no checkout and no billing anywhere across dendrite.holdings, the SOMA GitHub, or the SOMA X account. Both shipped artefacts are given away free \u2014 SOMARIZER is a free demo and the OpenClaw compression plugin was open-sourced on 6 Aug 2026 (https://x.com/SomaSubnet/status/... 'The repository is live... now open source'). The only revenue-adjacent product, the SOMA CLI tool, is explicitly gated behind an early-access signup form as of 11 Aug 2026, i.e. not yet sold. Their own token 'Conviction Program' (a 50% bonus for locking SN114 tokens) is a tokenomics mechanic, not customer revenue, and was postponed on 7 Aug 2026 pending their own audit of Subtensor's conviction code.",
