    revenue_evidence: "No disclosed revenue figure found anywhere. Two items that look like revenue but are NOT: (1) a 1,000 TAO 'strategic investment' from @Ever_BlueGreen announced 2026-03-18 \u2014 that is investment/pool commitment, not revenue; (2) '$2M locked in conviction' cited in their 2026-06-24 anniversary post \u2014 that is miner alpha locked on-chain, not customer payment. They do advertise paid custom builds ('Need one customized for your use case? Our lab can build it in weeks', 2026-07-28), so I cannot assert zero revenue, but I found no evidence of any paid engagement. Hence unknown rather than confirmed_pre_revenue.",
